      ],
      "en": "They return at evening, howling like dogs, and prowl around the city.",
      "ko": "저희가 저물게 돌아와서 개처럼 울며 성으로 두루 다니고",
      "source_text_hash": "96739875a85018e765c28730c3e9260a87c01a50781d266dbcc42f0c4a4f4f1a",
      "translation_text_hash": "b18a8bd39cb2c7e23c2369621e7755e3c8882c09b3a920c005be51225dea30cb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
