      "ko": "여호와여 주께서 저희를 웃으시리니 모든 열방을 비웃으시리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "b33eab7d6190fa921f86a90752c74710ce473008b0dafdb7c835ee085902cd1b",
      "translation_text_hash": "76d042d41c9764c9733f08ef9d330513016f7b0d0804ad280418d01722923d0c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
